  "description": "D Street Projekt 8 starts with the simplicity of a single speed, then dials up the versatility a notch with 8 terrain conquering speeds from Shimano with Tektro 317 brakes front and rear. It sports a riser bar that has a 30mm rise and a 600mm width. Alloy 32-hole rims keep things light, stainless steel spokes keep things clean, Kenda 700x28c tires keep things smooth. Like all D Streets, the Projekt 8 is elegant and understated. If flies straight and true, just like you...\nCustom D-Street hi-ten urban frameset\nNew overised alloy riser bars, 660mm wide\nAlloy 3-piece crankset with sealed BB\nShimano 8 speed drivetrain\nTektro R317 brakeset\nKenda 700 x 28c tires\nSturdy 32 hole alloy wheelset with doublewall rims",
